vanda/SeachAndSort","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Given a list of numbers by the user, this program will find the element the user is searching for.","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194414},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/shapes","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/shapes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have multiple shapes. Each shape does something different depending on what it is.","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194415},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/quilts","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/quilts","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have a business that sells quilts of the same pattern, but different sizes depending on the customers needs. A customer is able to request a quilt with this pattern as big as they want.","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194416},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/diceGame","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/diceGame","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have 2 die, 6 sided each I start the game and print the intro  \u201cHey! Welcome to Tina\u2019s Dice Game.\u201d \u201cLet\u2019s start!\u201d The computer randomly generates what side of the die is chosen (for each die) I then add both of the random numbers together  I then print  Dice 1 = (the random number I got)  Dice 2 = (the random number I got) Depending on what number I get, something different is printed to the screen If I get an even number  I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cEvens are better than odds!\u201d If I get an odd number I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cOdds are still cool!\u201d At the end, I ask the user if they want to play again If the answer is \u201cYES\u201d  I \u201cthrow\u201d the die again and repeat the printing process If the answer is anything but YES (case-sensitive) I end the game and print the outro  \u201cThe number of times the dice was thrown is: (value of times dice is thrown)\u201d \u201cNice game!\u201d \u201cThanks for playing, Come play again soon!\u201d\u2028","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194417},{"name":"ryzngard/VSToolBoxAnalyzer","owner":"ryzngard","html_url":"https://github.com/ryzngard/VSToolBoxAnalyzer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194471},{"name":"TseChapman/DungeonGrit","owner":"TseChapman","html_url":"https://github.com/TseChapman/DungeonGrit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Course project for Introduction to Game Development class from the University of Washington Bothell","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194472},{"name":"dfoverdx/wordless-search","owner":"dfoverdx","html_url":"https://github.com/dfoverdx/wordless-search","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Generates a word search with exactly 2 words","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194526},{"name":"mikehall-ms/FlipdotEmulator","owner":"mikehall-ms","html_url":"https://github.com/mikehall-ms/FlipdotEmulator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Windows desktop Flipdot Emulator","topics":[],"score":2197,"global_rank":194546}]